  "description": "If you’re trying to use the van less and the bike more, then the Munroe Cargo is the bike for you. Specifically designed aluminium frame for load carrying with its frame-mounted front rack with a 30 kg capacity, a double top tube and tall head tube deliver a stable ride with good visibility, even when loaded. Having a smaller front wheel aids manoeuvrability and both wheels have wide rims and fat Kenda tyres for strength. A 36 / 22T crankset coupled with a 9 speed 11 – 36T cassette allows you to keep the pedals spinning whatever the cargo. Shimano hydraulic brakes will keep you and your load safely under control and being a Bombtrack, there are bottle, rack and fender mounts on the frame for all your extra’s.\n\nWeight frame: 3240 g frame (size M, incl. TA, hanger, rack and bolts)",
